1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,803
Stand up, friends!

2
00:00:01,803 --> 00:00:03,808
Let's dance like animals!

3
00:00:04,358 --> 00:00:06,213
Sing along with us!

4
00:00:07,563 --> 00:00:10,506
Hop like a bunny, hop, hop, hop!

5
00:00:10,806 --> 00:00:12,408
Hop like a bunny,

6
00:00:12,408 --> 00:00:13,609
now we stop!

7
00:00:14,709 --> 00:00:17,753
Waddle like a duck, quack, quack, quack!

8
00:00:18,053 --> 00:00:20,775
Waddle forward, waddle back!

9
00:00:21,875 --> 00:00:23,210
Dance, dance,

10
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,879
the animal dance!

11
00:00:25,179 --> 00:00:26,641
Move your body,

12
00:00:26,641 --> 00:00:28,022
take a chance!

13
00:00:29,122 --> 00:00:31,106
Stomp like an elephant,

14
00:00:31,106 --> 00:00:32,327
