17
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:39,816
Swim like a fish, swish, swish, swish!

18
00:00:40,116 --> 00:00:43,140
Wiggle your arms like a little fish!

19
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,575
Dance, dance,

20
00:00:45,575 --> 00:00:47,244
the animal dance!

21
00:00:47,544 --> 00:00:49,006
Move your body,

22
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:50,387
take a chance!

23
00:00:51,487 --> 00:00:53,415
Flap like a butterfly,

24
00:00:53,415 --> 00:00:54,571
