25
00:00:54,871 --> 00:00:56,378
Flutter, flutter,

26
00:00:56,378 --> 00:00:57,432
in the sky!

27
00:00:58,532 --> 00:01:00,102
Roar like a lion,

28
00:01:00,102 --> 00:01:01,516
