29
00:01:01,816 --> 00:01:03,352
Roar, roar, roar,

30
00:01:03,352 --> 00:01:04,658
nice and loud!

31
00:01:05,758 --> 00:01:07,094
Dance, dance,

32
00:01:07,094 --> 00:01:08,762
the animal dance!

33
00:01:09,062 --> 00:01:10,524
Move your body,

34
00:01:10,524 --> 00:01:11,905
take a chance!

35
00:01:13,005 --> 00:01:15,243
Great job, little learner!

36
00:01:15,793 --> 00:01:17,682
Share Mimzi with a friend,

37
00:01:17,682 --> 00:01:20,222
and subscribe for more learning fun!

38
00:01:20,772 --> 00:01:21,647
Next time,

39
00:01:21,647 --> 00:01:24,340
let's sing the brush your teeth song.

40
00:01:24,590 --> 00:01:25,961
Bye bye!
